  "passage_full": "People can take a shower at any time if they are hot. Here is an invention that we cannot live without on a summer day. Can you guess what it is?\n\nOn the coldest winter evening in 1905, Frank tried to invent a new sweet and colourful drink. That night, he did some experiments outside his house. He left the glass of the fruit-flavoured mixture with a stirring stick in it. The next morning, Frank found the mixture frozen to the stick because it was too cold. He tried it and found it was delicious. He was too poor to buy nice things for his wife, so he decided to patent his 'frozen ice on a stick'.\n\nFrank began producing his ice lollies in different flavours. By then he was rich enough to invent a machine to manufacture ice lollies. Later, his son George renamed the ice lolly 'Popsicle' in honour of his dad.",
